→ List.Perm.{u_2} (List.filterMap.{u_1, u_2} f l₁) (List.filterMap.{u_1, u_2} f l₂)","unsafe":false,"value":990,"source":{"code":"theorem Perm.filterMap (f : α → Option β) {l₁ l₂ : List α} (p : l₁ ~ l₂) :\n    filterMap f l₁ ~ filterMap f l₂ := by\n  induction p with\n  | nil => simp\n  | cons x _p IH => cases h : f x <;> simp [h, IH, Perm.cons]\n  | swap x y l₂ => cases hx : f x <;> cases hy : f y <;> simp [hx, hy, swap]\n  | trans _p₁ _p₂ IH₁ IH₂ => exact IH₁.trans IH₂","start":197,"end":203},"axioms":["propext"]}